@startuml AnalytiCore_Demo_Activity
title AnalytiCore Note App — Demonstrated Workflow Activity Diagram
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #D97706
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #2563EB

|Local User|
start
:Open AnalytiCore app\n(http://localhost:3000);

|AnalytiCore App|
:Restore documents from\nMySQL on startup;

if (MySQL storage available?) then (yes)
  :Load documents,\nchunks & original files;
else (no)
  :Show storage warning;\nContinue with empty / in-memory state;
endif

|Local User|
:Choose starting view;

if (Which demo path?) then (API & Model Setup)
  |Local User|
  :Set Ollama endpoint,\nmodel, temperature &\ncontext window;
  note right
    Optional but required
    before a successful
    agent answer.
  end note
  |Local User|
  :Return to main workflow;

elseif (Dashboard & Analytics) then
  |AnalytiCore App|
  :Compute upload / table metrics;
  if (Structured table detected\nin ready uploads?) then (yes)
    :Render retail charts\n(visits, spend, popular items);
    :Offer K-means clustering &\nlinear regression on selected dataset;
    if (Dated product-price history\nhas ≥ 3 observations?) then (yes)
      :Show product price forecast;
    else (no)
      :Show forecast unavailable message;
    endif
  else (no / narrative only)
    :Prompt user to upload\nstructured CSV / TXT / PDF table;
    note right
      Narrative files stay
      usable by the agent but
      cannot drive charts.
    end note
  endif
  |Local User|
  :Optionally open chat or\ngo to Data Ingestion;

else (Data Ingestion / Chat)
endif

' ===== Data ingestion branch =====
|Local User|
:Upload PDF / CSV / TXT file;

|AnalytiCore App|
if (Supported type &\nsize ≤ 50 MB?) then (no)
  :Mark document status = error\n(unsupported type or oversize);
  stop
else (yes)
  :Persist metadata + original file\nto MySQL (status = indexing);
  :Extract selectable text locally;
  if (Readable text extracted?) then (no)
    :Mark status = error\n(empty / unreadable;\nscanned PDF without OCR fails);
    :Persist error state to MySQL;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Mark status = ready;\nChunk text & save to MySQL;
  endif
endif

|Local User|
:Choose next demonstration step;

if (Continue with?) then (Analytics)
  |AnalytiCore App|
  :Refresh dashboard metrics &\ncharts from ready documents;
  |Local User|
  :Inspect charts / ML outputs;

elseif (Manage files) then
  |Local User|
  if (Download or Delete?) then (Download)
    |AnalytiCore App|
    :Serve original file from\nmemory or MySQL API;
  else (Delete)
    |AnalytiCore App|
    :Delete document + chunks\nfrom MySQL (cascade);
  endif

else (Ask Business Analyst agent)
endif

' ===== Agent Q&A with emerging technology =====
|Local User|
:Open floating chat &\nenter business question;

|AnalytiCore App|
if (Question empty?) then (yes)
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (Looks like a follow-up?\nshort text or cue words) then (yes)
  :Build retrieval query from\nprevious + current question;
else (no)
  :Use current question\nas retrieval query;
endif

:Filter ready documents &\nsplit into text chunks;
:Score chunks by keyword match\n(local retrieval, not embeddings);

if (Keyword matches found?) then (yes)
  :Take top ≤ 5 matching chunks;
else (no / no ready docs)
  :Use representative excerpts\nfrom imported files (if any);
endif

if (Structured tables present?) then (yes)
  :Compute local aggregates\n(row counts, sums, averages,\nranges, category values);
  :Attach aggregates +\nrepresentative rows to context;
else (no)
  :Proceed with text excerpts only;
endif

partition "**Emerging technology**\nLocal generative LLM (Llama 3 via Ollama)" {
  |Ollama / Llama 3|
  :Send conversation history +\nquestion + retrieved excerpts\nto configured Ollama endpoint;
  note right
    Emerging / prototype AI step:
    local Llama 3 (or selected model)
    generates the analyst answer.
    No DB, shell, or tool calling.
  end note

  if (Endpoint reachable &\nmodel returns content?) then (yes)
    :Return generated answer;
  else (no / empty / unreachable)
    :Return endpoint / model\nerror message to chat UI;
  endif
}

|AnalytiCore App|
:Display assistant reply\nin chat history;

|Local User|
:Review answer;\noptionally ask follow-up\nor return to analytics / upload;

stop

legend right
  |= Path |= Meaning |
  | Happy path | Upload → ready → retrieve → **Llama 3** → answer |
  | Alt: validation fail | Unsupported type / >50 MB / no text → error |
  | Alt: no keyword hits | Representative excerpts (or empty context) |
  | Alt: Ollama fail | User-visible connectivity / empty-response error |
  | Alt: no structured table | Charts/ML skipped; chat still possible |
endlegend

@enduml
